{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t宏福苑火災獨立委員會報告提出，杜絕樓宇維修工程招標程序涉及的不當行為。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n當局將修改包括《競爭條例》等3條現行法律，包括將圍標行為刑事化，以加強打擊樓宇維修圍標行為。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：詹可揚\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T12:21:52.073026+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":89,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T12:01:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T02:38:44.330938+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T12:18:36.981885+00:00","content_hash":"e10293545d98f7932f3fc77cc8a8b5b9768b97e9c3f01b5a39ba0e69115314ee","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}